From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hansen0411 <hansennguyen.ee14@nycu.edu.tw>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Nexys A7: debug over the on-board USB (BSCANE2) and the
 on-board PDM microphone

- vendored riscv_dbg: TCK of the BSCANE2 DTM on a BUFG (a placement change broke the debug
  module: "Debug Module did not become active"); constraints/common/bscan.xdc constrains it,
  added to the FPGA core under use_bscane_xilinx. Kept for re-vendoring as
  hw/vendor/patches/pulp_platform_riscv_dbg/0002-bscane-tck-on-a-bufg.patch.
- vendored xheep_fpga_support: PDM pins J5 (M_CLK) and H5 (M_DATA) of the on-board ADMP421,
  rst_i_IBUF on local routing; kept as hw/vendor/patches/xheep_fpga_support/0001-*.patch
  (patch_dir added to xheep_fpga_support.vendor.hjson).
- configs/kws_nexys.py: configs/general.py + PDM2PCM at 0x30060000 (make mcu-gen X_HEEP_CFG=...).
- tb/core-v-mini-mcu-nexys-bscan.cfg, tb/nexys-a7-program-fpga.cfg: OpenOCD over the on-board
  FTDI (no external JTAG adapter).
